          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä mi ca ji̱ duer duer (kɛ ɣöö thilɛ ram mi ci dui̱r) kä ci gaak kɛ kɛ kä bikɛ la̱th tetdä gua̱n tɛ̈r, kä cɛ kɛ pɛ̈c muun go̱lä mi na̱n kiɛ thia̱k, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä mi wä kɛn lɔcdiɛn ri̱t muun in cakɛ pɛ̈c thi̱n, kä cikɛ rɔ̱ riet ji̱ ɛn muun nɛɛni tin cakɛ pɛ̈c thi̱n a lar kɛ jɛ i̱, ‘Cakɔ duer, cakɔ mi jiääk la̱t,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä mi cikɛ rɔ̱ ri̱t kɛ lɔcdiɛn kɛɛliw kɛnɛ ca̱riɛn kɛɛliw muun ɛ cakɛ naŋ thi̱n ɛ la pëëc ɔ. Mi wäkɛ pal luɔtkɛ ni mundiɛn ëë ci ka̱m gua̱ni, kɛnɛ wec ɛ ci mɛk ɛ kɛ luak ɛ ca lät kɛ kui̱ cio̱tädu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liŋ paliɛn ni nhial gua̱th cieŋädu. Kä käm nikɛ min ca thiec, kä päli nɛɛku tin ca ji̱ duer duer dueerkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ lö Kuothdä, guic nɛy kä liŋ pal ɛ palkɛ mi ɛn guäth ɛmɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
